af=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌确认新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入后训练阶段，有望远早于年底发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind负责人科拉伊·卡武克奥卢在AI Agenda Live峰会上确认，新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入后训练（Post-training）初期阶段，有望远早于年底推出。该模型将是继Gemini 3系列后的重大迭代，谷歌已跳过此前传闻的Gemini 3.5 Pro，将研发重心全面转向Gemini 4。目前，Gemini 4正处于防护机制开发与安全测试阶段，谷歌工程师已在内部利用该模型运行Antigravity AI编程工具。卡武克奥卢表示，团队正加速推进后训练成果，以确保模型行为的可靠性。针对行业竞争，谷歌强调当前核心目标是构建值得信任的智能体（Agent），而非单纯讨论AGI的实现。此次发布将标志着谷歌在旗舰模型领域重回快速迭代节奏，旨在通过更强的推理能力巩固其技术前沿地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a4bff8a49fa33f8572fdc481f881ca00.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 24, 202626智元把具身智能的产能刻度又往前推了一大格。9月24日，第20000台通用具身智能机器人远征A3Ultra在横琴长隆飞船乐园正式走下产线，并当场交到长隆集团手里。从今年3月跨过万台门槛到如今的两万台，这家公司只用了约6个月——产能爬坡的曲线，已经明显进入了加速段。同一天，由智元与长隆联手打造的全球首个大规模具身智能主题乐园在横琴长隆飞船乐园启幕，超过300台智元全系机器人开始在园区里常态化上岗，扎进游客互动、导览、演艺和科普研学等场景。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI在ChatGPT移动端上线语音智能体功能，支持语音指令执行任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd51c491a1a376446f6771e9bdc289bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式在ChatGPT移动端推出基于语音的智能体功能，用户通过语音指令即可完成文档撰写、邮件总结及Slack消息处理等任务。该功能将ChatGPT的语音交互从传统的问答模式升级为端到端的任务执行。在权限划分上，Pro和Plus订阅用户可利用该智能体创建文档、制作PPT、构建网站及调用云端浏览器；Free和Go订阅用户则支持通过插件连接应用。此外，Plus用户可在手机端处理工作后无缝切换至电脑端继续操作，并实现文本与语音输出的灵活转换。此次更新标志着ChatGPT在移动端生产力场景的进一步渗透，通过语音交互直接驱动复杂工作流，显著提升了移动办公的自动化执行效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta Connect发布会发布多款AI眼镜并宣布Muse接入智能硬件生态</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0596dd329feb9582c2f0b2e7dba946d3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在9月23日的Meta Connect大会上，Meta发布多款AI硬件并宣布个人智能体Muse全面接入智能眼镜。硬件方面，Meta推出无摄像头版Ray-Ban Meta Audio Glasses（349美元）及新款Ray-Ban Meta Gen 3（449美元），后者搭载1200万像素摄像头与6麦克风阵列。此外，Meta预告了重量仅100克的轻量级VR眼镜（2027年春季上市，1299美元起）及独立终端Muse Charm。软件层面，Muse已接入智能眼镜，支持语音唤醒、环境理解及购物辅助，并拥有独立邮箱地址；Mac端Muse App将具备计算机操作能力。Meta计划到2026年底提供超100种AI眼镜款式，并为听力受损用户推出听力增强功能。Muse自9月8日发布以来已登顶美区应用商店榜单，Meta未来将通</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek年化收入突破10亿美元，拟募资500亿元冲刺上交所上市</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/58f6242907fbe1a7a1c35a2eb3f7b308.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek年化收入已突破10亿美元，较数月前实现翻倍增长，主要得益于产品定价上调及开发者与企业端采用率的提升。首席执行官梁文峰在投资者会议上披露了该财务数据。目前，DeepSeek正处于第二轮融资的关键阶段，计划在10月底前完成募资500亿元人民币，投后估值预计达5000亿元人民币，并正紧锣密鼓筹备在上交所上市。在生成式AI商业化面临盈利审视的背景下，DeepSeek的业绩表现印证了其大模型技术的商业落地能力。此次巨额募资与上市计划不仅创下国内大模型初创企业一级市场资本规模新纪录，也为本土AI企业冲刺公开资本市场提供了重要参考，具有显著的行业风向标意义。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
